OL,3,GNEWSAChildren 'in danger' unless speed 
OL,4,Alimit changed                          
OL,6,FResidents are calling for the speed    
OL,7,Flimit on "rat run" streets in Surrey to
OL,8,Fbe reduced.                            
OL,10,FThere are concerns for the safety of   
OL,11,Fchildren and elderly people in Merstham
OL,12,Fbecause of drivers speeding in the     
OL,13,Ftown, particularly around Albury Road  
OL,14,Fand Chilberton Drive.                  
OL,16,FA petition is urging Surrey County     
OL,17,FCouncil to "work with the community to 
OL,18,Fassess the area" and change the speed  
OL,19,Flimit from 30mph to 20mph.             
OL,23,APub: 27-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
